E_N+ - [3Mg2 a+^3 H+^2 - m4 Mg2 a+^3 V+ - c+] = 0
E_N- - [3Mf2 a-^3 H-^2 - m4 Mg2 a+^3 V-  - c-] = 0
  => minus Friedmann: 6H-^2 = 2 rho-/Mf2 + 2 m4 (Mg2/Mf2) V-/Y^3  (power Y^-3, since a+^3/a-^3)
P+ = a+' E_a+ - N+ dE_N+/dt = 3*Mg2*m4*(-Nm(t)*Derivative(ap(t), t) + Np(t)*Derivative(am(t), t))*(b1*ap(t)**2 + 2*b2*am(t)*ap(t) + b3*am(t)**2)
P- = a-' E_a- - N- dE_N-/dt = -3*Mg2*m4*(-Nm(t)*Derivative(ap(t), t) + Np(t)*Derivative(am(t), t))*(b1*ap(t)**2 + 2*b2*am(t)*ap(t) + b3*am(t)**2)
P+ in terms of H+,H-,Y,N: 3*Mg2*m4*(Hm*Y - Hp)*(Y**2*b3 + 2*Y*b2 + b1)*Nm(t)*Np(t)*ap(t)**3
P+ + P- = 0
beta0 must be 0 for Pi_+(Y)=3 b2 Y(Y-Y0) with b1=-b2*Y0: V+ = -3*am(t)**2/ap(t)**2 + 6*am(t)/ap(t)

